      "statement": "Documented primary knobs carry documented defaults: CELD_ACTIVATIONS (min(cpu,128)), CELD_DEPLOY_POLL_S=30, CELD_DEPLOY_MAX_AGE_S=60, CELD_OPERATION_DEADLINE_MS=15000, CELD_MAX_CELL_REQUESTS=64, CELD_MAX_REQUEST_BODY_BYTES=1GiB, CELD_OUTPUT_GATE=1, CELD_DURABILITY=fleet, CELD_LOG_CAPTURE_WORKERS=8, CELD_LOG_PIPELINE=4, CELD_LTX_TRUNCATE_PAGES=128, CELD_LTX_COMPACTION=1, CELD_LTX_COMPACTION_MIN_TXIDS=256, CELD_LTX_COMPACTIONS=2, CELD_LTX_DURABILITY_TIMEOUT_SECS=10; the full list lives in `celld -h`.",
